    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d692">

                <pb facs="0744" n="732" xml:id="pg732"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.8595/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-03-16T19:00:00-03:00">March 16, 1942—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>888. For the Acting Secretary. My 855, March 13, 10 p.m.<anchor n="11"
                        xml:id="d692-f1"/> Aranha keeps after me as to what we are doing to insure
                    maritime communications.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
